15915 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Each block\047s header serves as the input to a SHA\055256\055based hash function\054 and the resulting value is stored in the \042Previous Block Hash\042 field of the next block\047s header\056 The transaction records in the block body are summarized into a single Merkle Root via a Merkle Tree\054 and this value is also included in the block header\056 Therefore\054 if any transaction record or block header field is altered\054 the hash of that block changes\054 and the chain of connections to all subsequent blocks is affected in turn\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 15916 0 R
