  << /ActualText (Quantum computing is a computational model that performs calculations using the principles of quantum mechanics\056 In the early 1980s\054 Richard Feynman proposed the need for a computational device capable of efficiently simulating quantum systems\056 Subsequently\054 in 1985\054 David Deutsch formalized the theoretical model of a universal quantum computer\056 Since then\054 the field has evolved into a distinct computational paradigm through the development of various quantum algorithms\056)
