  << /ActualText (The threat quantum computers pose to Bitcoin splits into two main vectors\056 One is Shor\047s Algorithm\054 which targets elliptic curve cryptography\054 and the other is Grover\047s Algorithm\054 which accelerates hash searches\056 Both algorithms impact Bitcoin\047s cryptographic foundations\054 but the nature of their threats differs\056 While Shor\047s Algorithm directly targets Bitcoin\047s control structure\054 Grover\047s Algorithm primarily weakens the cost structure of Proof of Work and hash searching\056\n\nProposed by Peter Shor in 1994\054 Shor\047s Algorithm demonstrated that if a               \176)
