16103 0 obj
  << /ActualText (A physical qubit is an individual qubit implemented in actual hardware\056 In contrast\054 a logical qubit is a stable computational unit formed by combining multiple physical qubits through quantum error\055correction techniques\054 enabling the detection and correction of errors that arise during computation\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 16104 0 R
     /Pg 5430 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
