16609 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The increase in data size associated with P2MR arises primarily when compared with Taproot\047s simplest key\055path spending method\056 By contrast\054 when comparing equivalent script\055path spends\054 P2MR can be smaller than a comparable Taproot script\055path spend because it does not include an internal public key\056 In other words\054 the cost increase of P2MR depends on the point of comparison\056 The key trade\055off is that reducing the long\055term exposure of public keys may increase block\055space consumption for certain spending methods\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 16610 0 R
     /Pg 14964 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

